The requirements for implementing a system-level continuous monitoring strategy include developing the strategy and implementing continuous monitoring in accordance with the organization-level continuous monitoring strategy. This includes:
- Establishing system-level metrics to be monitored (ca-07_odp.01);
- Establishing parameters/frequencies for monitoring (ca-07_odp.02) and assessment of control effectiveness (ca-07_odp.03);
- Conducting ongoing control assessments;
- Ongoing monitoring of system and organization-defined metrics;
- Correlation and analysis of information generated by assessments and monitoring;
- Response actions to address the analysis results; and
- Reporting the security and privacy status of the system to designated personnel/roles (ca-7_prm_4, ca-7_prm_5).
